{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（4日）上午10時39分，警方接報青衣路20號香港專業教育學院（青衣分校）地下的儲物室冒煙。影片可見，現場冒出大量濃煙，人員正動用兩喉、兩煙帽隊灌救，約400名師生及20多名工人疏散，初步沒有受傷報告。</p><p>消息稱，起火地點為新大樓內的士多房, 擺放雜物，當時有工人進行工程。有網民上載走火警的情況，可見大批學生走到地下操場，秩序良好。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員到場灌救。（Threads/ryanly_aberg圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172507847951650816640583.jpeg/cgGrPhFpch4mo1YCTq8_q9cGrAHjsn-FrBdw46wXcOM\"/><figcaption>消防員到場灌救。（Threads/ryanly_aberg圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"校園內冒出白煙（Threads/_._.tung._圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172507844931620864879124.jpeg/S_kbwsGqBFkHooj1ofdC9i-FG_7Kl2fw0Zc4fNGXOHw\"/><figcaption>校園內冒出白煙（Threads/_._.tung._圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批學生疏散。（Threads / peace_of_shift）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172512216050569216826470.jpeg/I-q9GWZR0IlRcMfLIuQibc1hCdtRxMLM1FTL89RUy_M\"/><figcaption>大批學生疏散。（Threads / peace_of_shift）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批學生疏散。（Threads / jimmyltm_）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172512218336595968604259.jpeg/5mOBDd1S4TFZC7sKs09zFwWeEtA3NBeTWwRNdFsETXQ\"/><figcaption>大批學生疏散。（Threads / jimmyltm_）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間學生疏散到地下。（Threads/tsz.ch.un圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172513313729286144682175.jpeg/jMPSveYzRa57ay6nXKlcGV_yJ2fg4-ifBzkXOQc5Fzk\"/><figcaption>火警期間學生疏散到地下。（Threads/tsz.ch.un圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間學生疏散到地下。（Threads/aidanpaker_0627圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172513315826569216982604.jpeg/fe3SIyvf2Q4jZeattTcmkD9vujmJw2CmZVRDrGVUQ6w\"/><figcaption>火警期間學生疏散到地下。（Threads/aidanpaker_0627圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間學生疏散到地下。（Threads/aidanpaker_0627圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172513318343282688836790.jpeg/oQUtNfXFgIzd5VEv6Yp4K7xFQmyVJcIBhp7xAIae8QA\"/><figcaption>火警期間學生疏散到地下。（Threads/aidanpaker_0627圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"校園冒出白煙。（Threads/megumin_ouo圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172513320436371456320719.jpeg/k-EOzrTMZyYmTcUWKIxhn3qKYQJQ27GRM32rlDN9q5Q\"/><figcaption>校園冒出白煙。（Threads/megumin_ouo圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青衣IVE冒煙。（Threads/chunmarcus0圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260904/1172507841940951040893571.jpeg/EtqiBjc4RAjrE60VzV8X9OU9NqkuJDX6K0wX0itMF9I\"/><figcaption>青衣IVE冒煙。（Threads/chunmarcus0圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T03:59:06.025481+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":471,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}